ly saturated with octanol was added into the solution. The mixture was shaken vigorously at room temperature overnight and then stood for 24 h. The concentration of Ir1-Ir6 was determined by UV-vis spectroscopy using extinction coefficients of the complexes in octanol saturated with water. The evaluation was replicated three times."}]}